00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:44.520
I should still have other weapons...

00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:49.130
I've always wanted to see what would 
happen if a hero who wouldn't die

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:51.450
were dismantled at the cellular level.

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:53.460
Finis clypeus...

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:56.040
Pito...

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:00.470
Take this!

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:02.370
Vendyne...

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:03.550
I hit her!

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:05.520
Incantation complete.

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:10.220
It's your reward for trying so hard.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.810
Be proud of this little 
scratch you gave me!

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:24.420
Are you stupid? This won't...

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:26.880
I don't expect to actually beat you.

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:28.040
At best...

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:31.280
I can force you to lower your guard 
and create and opening!

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:35.110
What are you—

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:40.790
Just one scratch is enough.

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:42.930
Why, you—

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:44.730
Grow all at once!

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:49.290
Reach maturity, Yggdramaple!

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:02.770
Wh-What was that?

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:05.440
The monsters...

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:10.790
Its magic effects have worn off!

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:12.280
Don't miss this opportunity!

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:16.060
Yuka! Shoot the magic 
circles on the golems!

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:16.780
Got it!

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:31.930
Just one left. I'm on it!

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.420
Mission complete!

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:39.680
That's the only one left!

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:43.060
Damn you!

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:49.300
This is for Iris, you bastard!

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:08.820
You kids have saved my life again.

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:18.990
Oh, you're finally awake.

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:22.610
Um...

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:24.380
Huh?

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:29.570
You were perpetually emitting mana 
because of that meteorite's power.

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:33.280
A normal human never could 
have withstood that.

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.990
Oh, right... Is she...

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:45.070
She's alive?

00:15:45.550 --> 00:15:46.370
Yes.

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:48.930
What should we do?

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:51.270
That should be obvious.

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:54.710
She killed a lot of people.

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:58.550
No!

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:02.540
Don't kill her!

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:07.670
What did I tell you? 
I've already killed someone.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:10.380
If you use that as a reason to kill again,

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:13.390
it's going to end up being a given...

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:16.000
and there'll be no going back!

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:20.880
All scum ought to die.

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:23.540
In the end, even I'll likely...

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:27.080
Until then, I'll kill those 
who ought to be killed.

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:32.220
<i>I should have greater strength, so how...</i>

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.340
You don't have to understand right now!

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:37.320
Please...

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:40.500
Don't close the door on your own future!

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:46.160
Glen-san...

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:51.780
Shouldn't we let the people of this 
world settle this world's affairs?

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:54.810
Fine.

00:16:57.060 --> 00:16:59.260
I have no intention of forgiving, though.

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:02.370
Not her sins...

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:05.950
nor my own.

00:17:12.520 --> 00:17:15.000
Are memories the only things you can control?

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:18.720
What?

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:22.590
I'm asking if you controlled 
my feelings, too!

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:39.310
The only one I love is my 
god, the Great Dragon!

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:42.280
I don't need love from anyone else!

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:46.000
Die, humans!

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:53.270
She killed herself with her own magic...

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:01.130
Thanks for answering me.

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:04.340
Goodbye.

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:09.470
The meteorite!

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:22.670
Lady Fahtina!

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:23.830
Huh?

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:28.560
Aw, I finally made it here, 
and it's already over.

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:31.780
Well, I did destroy that 
dangerous thing, at least,

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:33.080
so it's all good.

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:35.310
That's the great sorceress?

00:18:35.310 --> 00:18:36.900
Kinda flippant, isn't she?

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:38.720
That's how she was last time.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:43.000
Oh, we're going to retrieve all 
of these fragments, Cantil.

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.420
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:48.700
If we leave these lying around, 
the dragon'll be back in no time.

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:50.450
The dragon...

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:51.150
Look!

00:18:58.560 --> 00:18:59.990
Wow...

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:01.280
New Eden...

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:09.300
This is wild...

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:11.620
Too bad I couldn't take a video of it.

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:14.300
You're still alive?!

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:16.590
It seems we've all been through a lot.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:20.560
Let's live in peace from now on.

00:19:20.870 --> 00:19:24.490
Great Hero, I can't thank you enough.

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:26.990
It's okay. But...

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:29.400
I do have one favor to ask.

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:31.810
Of course. Ask us for anything.

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:34.810
You heroes are this city's saviors!

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:38.740
I hear this town doesn't have a name.

00:19:39.270 --> 00:19:41.420
Could I ask you to give it one?

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:43.900
A... name?

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:45.650
Yes.

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:50.480
Call it Zagroth.

00:19:55.240 --> 00:19:59.640
Now, Warrior (Axe) Glenda Carter...

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:01.800
You get one question as a reward.

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:15.660
How could the dragon appear 
in our own world?

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:19.810
There is a small hole that 
connects the two worl.

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:24.450
That hole continues to widen

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:27.110
until, eventually, the dragon will ent.

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:41.980
Wanna check out that shop 
by the south gate?

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:43.350
Yeah, let's go.

00:20:43.350 --> 00:20:44.960
That place has a nice vibe.

00:20:50.670 --> 00:20:53.980
Hey, Yuusuke! On your way home?

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.650
Yes, I am.

00:20:56.180 --> 00:20:59.600
Now that we've run into each other, 
let's hang out somewhere!

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:01.540
Aren't you on your way to work?

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:05.590
Jeez! Even in this world, he's so cold!

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:10.490
Wow, this is well-made!

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:13.030
Yeah, well, I practiced like crazy.

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:15.910
Iu-chan and Yotsuya-kun were both amazing.

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:17.320
Yotsuya, too?

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:21.220
Come to think of it, he seems 
like he's changed lately.

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:24.770
That was the promise he made with Iu-chan.

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:27.240
Well, I guess he's a bit better now.

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:29.970
He's still putting on an act, though.

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:33.300
Oh, I never sent you the pictures 
from last time, did I?

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:36.070
Last time? Oh, I guess you didn't.

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:38.860
Sorry! I thought I sent them.

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:39.940
Party (6)

