Yukarion

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:41.690
<b>Majiha
Arrow!</b>

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:42.930
I'll send them to everyone.

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:43.190
<b>Majiha
Arrow!</b>

00:21:42.930 --> 00:21:44.990
Even though Yotsuya-kun 
probably won't like it.

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:44.190
Here are the pictures from the other day!

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:51.620
<b>Under Construction</b>

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:51.620
Safety First

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:51.620
<b>Your cooperation
is appreciated</b>

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:52.820
Hey, these look great!

00:21:52.820 --> 00:21:53.960
Yo, part-timer!

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:54.280
Oh, shit!

00:21:54.840 --> 00:21:56.630
Yeah, yeah, got it!

00:21:57.200 --> 00:22:01.630
Man... Everyone called me 
"Great Hero" in the other world...

00:22:02.230 --> 00:22:03.770
Torii the Hero!

00:22:18.840 --> 00:22:21.030
You still hate this city?

00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:22.010
Whoa!

00:22:22.010 --> 00:22:24.320
Seriously, stop popping up out of nowhere!

00:22:27.410 --> 00:22:31.250
Last time, you asked me if I understood 
the value of life, right?

00:22:34.000 --> 00:22:36.290
I still hate this city.

00:22:37.090 --> 00:22:40.820
And I can't answer about 
the value of life. But...

00:22:41.180 --> 00:22:42.150
But?

00:22:43.190 --> 00:22:45.240
There's something I've come to realize.

00:22:45.240 --> 00:22:49.960
There are thousands, even millions, 
of people living in that other world,

00:22:49.960 --> 00:22:54.100
and something is constantly being 
sacrificed for them to stay alive.

00:23:02.170 --> 00:23:03.300
And?

00:23:05.580 --> 00:23:07.150
I've made up my mind.

00:23:08.270 --> 00:23:10.250
I'll see it through to the end.

00:23:12.650 --> 00:23:14.360
I doubt I can escape it.

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:18.960
My actions—all of our actions—
shape that world.

00:23:22.190 --> 00:23:24.810
Whether I like it or not, 
we're being forced to stand...

00:23:28.620 --> 00:23:30.890
on a million lives.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>On a Million Lives</b>
